  id: Fortress
  displayName: Shelter
  role: Capital / HQ / Research Era / Research Economy / Worker upgrades / resource
    drop-off / Supply generation / Objective
  description: The capital - the Shelter in Age 0, the Fortress from age-up. Every
    player starts the match with one and never has another. Only siege with a large
    army behind it brings it down; it leaves rubble, and a player whose Fortress is
    not rebuilt on that rubble in time is out of the match. Trains Workers and Scouts (and, for
    Alanthor, the Ledger and King Lexor), hosts the capital's research, and LOCKS
    its territory so no army can take it while it stands.
